Error [jet.ReadOnlyValueNotOwned]: `value` was not moved here, so it cannot fill an owned field
  --> Tests/UI/ownership_copy_edit_provenance.jet:7:58
    |
  7 | wrap: fn(value: String) -> Holder { return Holder{value: value} }
    |                                                          ^^^^^
 Why: This function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: Copy it explicitly with `value.copy()`
